description:
Hello, our name is Customertimes, but you can call us CT. We are a global digital engineering, product development, and technology consulting company. Headquartered in New York, we have a team of 1000+ experts working across 65+ countries.
Location: Pune
How you'll make an impact:
- Own quality for a Service Cloud rollout that moves a global tech company's consumer product support onto Salesforce;
- Plan and run functional, integration, regression, and UAT testing across Service Cloud: cases, routing, entitlements, knowledge, and channels;
- Write test cases from user stories and keep traceability in Jira or a test management tool;
- Build and maintain automated Salesforce tests inside the CI/CD pipeline, and help build the regression suite that runs on every release;
- Validate the data migration: record counts, field mapping, relationships, attachments, and history;
- Test profiles, permission sets, and sharing so each user sees and edits only what they should;
- Report defects clearly, retest fixes, and support business users through UAT;
- Future scope: test AI agents on Salesforce, including what an agent can and cannot change.
What makes you a great fit:
- 4+ years in software QA, with 2+ years testing Salesforce;
- Hands-on Service Cloud testing, such as case management or Omni-Channel;
- Test automation on Salesforce with at least one of Provar, Copado Robotic Testing, ACCELQ, or Selenium;
- Solid understanding of Salesforce security: profiles, permission sets, sharing, and field-level security;
- API testing with Postman or a similar tool;
